From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:39:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge the HD movies follow-ups (sampling, decoder hand-back,
 logging) into all

Brings in:
* gl: sample a native HD movie frame exactly as its binder described it
* hd movies: give the pictures, frames and decoder back when no movie plays; report the rate a movie held
* hd movies: give the original decoder the parameter sets when it takes over
* hd movies: say in the log, without a trace switch, how many replacement movies were found

